[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なるほど……経緯は分かりました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see... I understand the circumstances now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい。何も弁解はしません",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. I have no excuses to offer."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "神官長様。\nこの人のしたことは許されないことですが……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Your Holiness, what this man did was unforgivable, but..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "......"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この国に混乱をもたらしたこと。\nそれは疑いようのない事実。よって、償いを命じます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That you brought chaos to this nation is an undeniable fact. Therefore, I must assign you penance."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これより１年間、聖戦士の指揮下に入り、\n魔物討伐の奉仕をしなさい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "For the next year, you will serve under the command of the Holy Warriors, performing service by vanquishing monsters."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうすれば、星はあなたを許すでしょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Do this, and the stars will forgive you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……！\u3000寛大なお心に、感謝します",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...! I am grateful for your mercy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お父さん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Daddy!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "少女",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Girl"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "も、もう歩いて大丈夫なのか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A-are you sure you should be walking around already?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん！\u3000もう、すっかり！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yep! I'm all better now!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "少女",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Girl"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい、これ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Here, this is for you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "少女",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Girl"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "頑張って償いをして、早く帰ってきてね。\n私、元気にして待ってるから！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Work hard and come home soon, okay? I'll be here waiting for you, healthy and strong!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "少女",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Girl"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ。頑張ってくるよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. I'll do my best."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さて、魔物の事件も解決できたようです。\nお二人には、まことに感謝を",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well then, it seems the monster incident has been resolved. You two have my deepest gratitude."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "使者として、役に立てて何よりだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're just glad we could fulfill our duties as envoys."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "このたびの取引、ランターナ王国には最大限の便宜を\n図ることをお約束しましょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I promise that the Kingdom of Lantarna will receive the most favorable terms in our trade agreement."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありがとうございます！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you so much!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "早速持ち帰り、ランターナ王国に伝えよう。では",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We'll take our leave and report back to the Kingdom of Lantarna right away."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "失礼する。諸島同盟監察局の者だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Pardon the intrusion. We're from the Archipelago Federation Oversight Bureau."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ、エルス殿。お役目ご苦労さまです。\nそちらの方は？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, Els. Thank you for your service. And this is?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "新人のタイニーです！\u3000以後お見知りおきを！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm the newbie, Tiny! Pleasure to meet you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "タイニー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tiny"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "例年通り、リンデ祭期間中はノーヴァ神聖国の\n見回りを行う予定だ。その事前通告に来たのだが……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "As per our annual routine, we'll be conducting patrols in Nova during the Linde Festival. We came to notify you in advance, but..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "エルス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Els"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "何やら近海で魔物が遺棄される事件があったと\n聞いた。その状況は？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I heard there was an incident involving monsters being dumped in the nearby waters. What's the status?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "エルス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Els"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ご心配おかけしました、すでに解決済みです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you for your concern, but the matter has already been resolved."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "か、解決したんですか！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-it's been resolved already?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "タイニー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tiny"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほう。この国にも優秀な人間がいるのだな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Impressive. It seems this country has some capable people after all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "エルス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Els"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "とんぼ返りかぁ……もう少し観光したかったなあ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heading straight back, huh... I was hoping to do a little more sightseeing."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "また来ればいいさ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We can always come back another time."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうだ兄さん、これ。\nえへへ。時間を見つけてこっそり買っておいたんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, here. Hehehe. I found some time to sneak out and buy this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……！\u3000チョコ、か？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...! Chocolate?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いつも、僕のことを守ってくれてありがとう。\nでもね、これからは僕も兄さんを守るんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you for always protecting me. But from now on, I'm going to protect you too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だから……これからもよろしくね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So... let's keep looking out for each other, okay?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（呪いに蝕まれ、ティムの時間は止まってしまったと\n\u3000そう思っていた）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Consumed by the curse, I thought Tim's time had stopped.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（克服した後も、俺が守らねばならない\n\u3000小さなティムのままだと……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Even after he overcame it, I thought he'd always be the little Tim who needed my protection...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ。ありがとう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. Thank you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えへへ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehehe."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（ああ。\n\u3000ティムの時間は、とっくに動き出していたんだな）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Ah. Tim's time had already started moving forward again, hadn't it?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]